{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1338928-the-dark-crystal-would-be-perfect-for-the-st-system","id":1338928,"title":"The Dark Crystal Would Be Perfect For The ST System","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-01T21:20:20-07:00","id":1338928,"title":"The Dark Crystal Would Be Perfect For The ST System","content":"Just saying.<br /> <br /> This is a 100% perfect match. Especially with The Dark Crystal being probably as popular as it's ever been.<br /> <br /> So uh... You hear that, Onyx Path?? I know you guys are busy and all, but get to it! Chop chop! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24164-marengo","name":"Marengo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-01T21:28:43-07:00","id":1338930,"title":"","content":"1) Onyx Path doesn\u2019t own Storyteller. You\u2019ll have to reach out to Paradox/White Wolf. If Onyx Path did it (unless as a license from White Wolf) it would have to be Storypath, ala Trinity Continuum, Scion, Dystopia Rising Evolution, They Came From Beneath the Sea....<br /> <br /> 2) Disney (who own the Jim Henson Company) have not been very interested in rpg licensing since Marvel Heroic Roleplaying failed to be the D&amp;D level hit that Disney is given to expect from anything under its brand umbrella<br /> <br /> Are they even licensing a Star Wars rpg anymore?<br /> <br /> So for Onyx Path to do a Storyteller system Dark Crystal rpg, you would have to have a double licensing situation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 10-02-2019, 02:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-01T21:42:41-07:00","id":1338932,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1098_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1098\" data-vbnamecard=\"1098\">glamourweaver</a> Oh my gosh, thank you for clearing that up. Honestly, I know I probably came off as brash in my post, but for reals, I appreciate all of the work that goes behind all of these games. And the Onyx Path/White Wolf situation is very confusing, so thank you for helping clear that up.<br /> <br /> That said...<br /> <br /> This is still a perfect fit. I mean, best case scenario, let's assume the always greedy Disney corporation wants to see the IP grow. Is it still feasible to present a pitch of any kind to the execs?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24164-marengo","name":"Marengo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-03T11:19:15-07:00","id":1339217,"title":"","content":"Out of curiosity, how is the Storytelling system perfect for expressing the action and metaphysics of Dark Crystal?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-04T21:55:48-07:00","id":1339523,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar99_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"99\" data-vbnamecard=\"99\">ArcaneArts</a> Well, to give the simple answer first, The Dark Crystal is a scary franchise, and the ST system is used for narrating horror games. Therefore, a lot of it, I feel, blends very well; the Gelflings, as PCs, are drastically overpowered by the Skeksis, so it makes every encounter in this world memorable and intense. Mechanics wise, while you'd have to switch some of the skills out, I feel the Attribute + Skill mechanic works well for having to interact with the world of Thra, with its fantastical world and natural technologies; as simple as it is, I always felt ST was a bit more meaty than the d20 system. I mean yeah, you could use another system like BRP or D20, but I just feel, flavor wise, it just pairs up really well.<br /> <br /> Imo.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24164-marengo","name":"Marengo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}